15
00:00:52,065 --> 00:00:54,579
Then, create a three-column text file.

16
00:00:54,579 --> 00:00:58,769
After that, check that onsets are within the run duration.

17
00:00:58,769 --> 00:01:02,121
The command shown on screen is an example.

18
